Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 20:02:47 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 411/443] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on 0410: a take is
 deaf only if it never heard a sample, loading routes to the server

A server take is called deaf only when no non-zero sample ever arrived (or the track is muted, or the audio context is not running at the 4 s check), so a quiet room under iOS voice processing no longer trips it. A Voice start on iOS while the server info is still loading goes to the server recognizer. A start with no Voice tap logs that the audio context was not unlocked, and an auto-armed start resumes the context a tap made earlier. A stop then an immediate start during a quiet deaf restart is no longer swallowed.
